mark (On paper, length of an edge is ) EdgeLength ScaleFactor mul (pt = ) 1 index 72 div (" = 1"/) 1 2 index div ( = ) 5 index 127 mul 360 div (mm = 1mm/) 1 2 index div ConcatenateToMark =


